# Week 6 — Generative AI Programming Practical

## Llama 3.2 baseline evaluation — Release v0.1

This folder contains the golden question set and Python runner for a local Ollama evaluation. It asks all 30 questions, scores answers by keyword coverage, and saves the results to `baseline_results.csv`.

### Run it

1. Install [Ollama](https://ollama.com/download) and start its local service.
2. Download Llama 3.2:
   ```powershell
   ollama pull llama3.2
   ```
3. From this folder, install the Python dependency and run the evaluation:
   ```powershell
   python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
   python main.py
   ```

Ollama must be reachable at `http://localhost:11434`. Request failures are recorded as `ERROR` in the CSV. Keyword coverage is a simple baseline metric and does not determine factual correctness.
